[0.011, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.019, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J Windy Meadow\u001b[1;85H1\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(0\u001b[0mqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq\u001b(B\u001b[6;1H\u001b(0\u001b[0m\u001b(B\"We're losing the patient!\"\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"Is that such a bad thing?\"\r\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"You have an oath!\"\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.001, "o", "Those are the voices you hear as you slip into the clouds swimming over your vision.\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"An oath this one never bothered to follow.\"\r\u001b[16dYou're trapped within the clouds now, a horde of angry, voluminous beasts that run and churn,\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "circling around you in a maelstrom that leads down (or up?) to a singular patch of light. As you\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "fall (or rise?) toward the eye of the storm, a high-pitched whine joins the voices. The whine\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "reaches a crescendo, one voice shouts... \"CLEAR!\"\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "Lightning strikes... everywhere... weaving a brilliant lattice across the clouds. Luminous fingers\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "caress you, electric claws rake you. It burns. So much burning. And light. So much light.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "And a sense of uncertainty. You don't know which way to go. Or, maybe, which way you went.\r\u001b[26d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mThe Life (and Deaths) of Doctor M\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mAn Interactive Deliverance by Michael D. Hilborn\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 6 / Serial number 120219 / Inform 7 build 6G60 (I6/v6.32 lib 6/12N)\u001b[29;100H"]
[2.473, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[18d(If you are new to this game, please type ABOUT for some important information. Experienced IF\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "players may also want to quickly learn about the CONVERSATION engine used for NPCs in this game.)\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mWindy Meadow\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYour vision clears as you gently land in an endless landscape pockmarked by loose shale and gray\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "scrub. Directly above you, the storm clouds that you fell (or rose?) through churn and roil in a\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "clockwise current, forming a funnel into the sky. And there is the wind, a bleak and chill thing,\r\u001b[25dmoaning as if it laments being left in this place.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "A wooden signpost stands here, barely holding its own against the wind.\r\u001b[29d>"]
