[0.000, "o", "\u001b[8M\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "2\r\u001b[22dStaked into the rock at an absurd angle, and barely holding its own against the wind. Nailed to the\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "top of the signpost are two arrows pointing in opposite directions. The words \"TO HERE\" are scrawled\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "upon one arrow; the words \"TO THERE\" have been etched into its companion.\r\u001b[26dAlthough direction seems meaningless here, if you were to assume that you are facing north, then \"TO\u001b[27;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "THERE\" appears to point east.\r\u001b[29d>"]
