[0.093, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[8M\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "3\r\u001b[22dStaked into the rock at an absurd angle, and barely holding its own against the wind. Nailed to the\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "top of the signpost are two arrows pointing in opposite directions. The words \"TO HERE\" are scrawled\u001b[24;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "upon one arrow; the words \"TO THERE\" have been etched into its companion.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "Although direction seems meaningless here, if you were to assume that you are facing north, then \"TO\u001b[27;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "THERE\" appears to point east.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mv\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.093, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[3M\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "4\r\u001b[27dYou are carrying nothing. You are wearing a lab coat.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mh\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.101, "o", "\u001b[7;26r\u001b[7;1H\u001b[8T\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;85H5\u001b[3;4H"]
[0.000, "o", " are carrying nothing. You are wearing a lab coat.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4d\u001b[K\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", ">\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mnorth\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "Using the signpost as a guide, you head out toward what you perceive as the north. You walk and\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "walk, glancing over your shoulder every few moments, making certain the signpost recedes. And yes,\r\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "it does, ultimately shrinking into the landscape. It's when you are satisfied that you can no longer\u001b[9;1Hsee it behind you that it abruptly makes its appearance in front of you.\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mWindy Meadow\r\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYou stand in an endless landscape pockmarked by loose shale and gray scrub. Directly above you, the\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "storm clouds churn and roil in a clockwise current, forming a funnel into the sky. And there is the\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "wind, a bleak and chill thing, moaning as if it laments being left in this place.\r\u001b[18dThe wind surges from moan to raging howl. The signpost shudders, leans back, then abruptly spins,\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "its arrows becoming a blur. As the wind settles back to its desolate moan, the signpost slowly comes\u001b[20;3H"]
[0.000, "o", " a halt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[21d\u001b[K\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "The clouds above blur, fade, revealing a silent vision that spans the sky--a circle of paramedics\r\u001b[23dlooking down upon you. They work frantically, violently gesturing  and shouting at each other.\u001b[K\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "The shoulders and neck of one paramedic stiffen, as if he uses both arms to press down on something\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "unseen. Lightning flickers to life, blinding you, and when your eyes adjust, the figures above are\r\u001b[27dgone, replaced by the roiling clouds.\u001b[K\r\u001b[29d>\u001b[K"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
