[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.101, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[8M\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "6\r\u001b[22d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mWindy Meadow\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mYou stand in an endless landscape pockmarked by loose shale and gray scrub. Directly above you, the\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "storm clouds churn and roil in a clockwise current, forming a funnel into the sky. And there is the\r\u001b[25dwind, a bleak and chill thing, moaning as if it laments being left in this place.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "A wooden signpost stands here, wavering in the wind.\r\u001b[29d>"]
